+/* ==========================================================================
+   v138 · LIGHT THEME CONTRAST HARDENING
+   Custom dark gradients previously kept their dark background while the global
+   light-theme remap changed white labels to dark text. These semantic surfaces
+   now receive native light variants, and native selects remain readable.
+   ========================================================================== */
+
+/* A frequently used legacy neutral surface was not covered by the original
+   light-mode utility map. Without this rule preset buttons stayed nearly black
+   while their labels were remapped to dark text. */
